<title>USA: Clinton says his tax cuts fully paid for.</title>
<headline>Clinton says his tax cuts fully paid for.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton said Thursday the federal budget deficit is on its way to zero and all his proposed tax cuts would be fully paid for.</p>
<p>&quot;These tax cuts...are all fully paid for in my balanced budget plan, line by line, dime by dime,&quot; Clinton said in his acceptance speech at the Democratic Party national convention.</p>
<p>Clinton said his tax cuts would focus on education.</p>
</text>
